://x.com/.../status/..."></label><label>Raid Image URL <span class="muted">(optional — X image is used automatically if left empty)</span><input id="imageUrl" placeholder="https://.../image.jpg"></label><label>TikTok URL<input id="ttUrl" placeholder="https://www.tiktok.com/@.../video/..."></label><label>Telegram<input id="tgUrl" placeholder="https://t.me/..."></label><input type="hidden" id="tgGroup" value="@rugcxx"><label>Pump.fun Callout URL<input id="calloutUrl" placeholder="https://pump.fun/callouts/..."></label><label>Raid Copy<textarea id="raidCopy" placeholder="Your raid message..."></textarea></label><div class="status" id="premiumStatus">Free raids are sent automatically to the official @rugcxx Telegram group. No wallet is required.</div></div></div><div class="panel"><div class="eyebrow">LOW-FRICTION PRICING</div><h2 style="font-size:26px;margin:8px 0 20px">Choose Your Raid</h2><div class="plans"><div class="plan featured"><b>FREE RAID</b><strong>0 SOL</strong><p>Basic raids are currently free.</p><button type="button" class="primary" id="launchFreeRaid">Launch Free Raid</button></div><div class="plan"><b>FEATURED</b><strong>0.02 SOL</strong><p>Featured placement for 24h.</p><button type="button" class="secondary" id="launchFeatured">Select</button></div><div class="plan"><b>MEGA RAID</b><strong>0.05 SOL</strong><p>X + TikTok + Telegram for 48h.</p><button type="button" class="primary" id="launchMega">Select</button></div><div class="plan"><b>FRONT ROW</b><strong>0.10 SOL</strong><p>Premium placement and 7-day campaign.</p><button type="button" class="secondary" id="launchFrontRow">Select</button></div></div><p class="muted" style="font-size:11px;line-height:1.5;margin-top:18px">Free raids need no wallet. A wallet is requested only when you choose a paid SOL package.</p></div></div></section>
