 id="saveCampaignEdit">SAVE CHANGES</button><button class="secondary" id="cancelCampaignEdit">CANCEL</button></div><div class="status manageStatus" id="editStatusMessage">No campaign selected.</div></div><div class="manageEmpty" id="manageEditorEmpty">Select <b>EDIT</b> on one of your campaigns to open the editor.</div></div></div></section><section class="page" id="page-analytics"><div class="grid"><div class="panel"><div class="panelHead"><div><div class="eyebrow">RAID ANALYTICS</div><h2 style="font-size:26px;margin-top:7px">Live Campaign Activity</h2></div><span class="tag">LIVE</span></div><div class="metrics"><div class="metric"><b id="aCampaigns">0</b><span>Active Campaigns</span></div><div class="metric"><b id="aRaids">0</b><span>Total Raid Actions</span></div><div class="metric"><b id="aX">0</b><span>X Clicks</span></div><div class="metric"><b id="aTikTok">0</b><span>TikTok Clicks</span></div><div class="metric"><b id="aTelegram">0</b><span>Telegram Clicks</span></div><div class="metric"><b id="aCallouts">0</b><span>Pump Callout Clicks</span></div><div class="metric"><b id="aMarket">0</b><span>Market Clicks</span></div></div></div><div class="panel"><div class="panelHead"><h2>How tracking works</h2><span class="tag">LIVE</span></div><p class="muted" style="line-height:1.6">Campaign links now pass through the command center first, record the platform action, then send the visitor to the original X, TikTok, Telegram or Pump.fun Callout URL.</p><div class="status" id="analyticsStatus">Loading live activity…</div></div></div></section>
<section class="page" id="page-leaderboard"><div class="grid"><div class="panel"><div class="panelHead"><div><div class="eyebrow">COMMUNITY REWARDS</div><h2 style="font-size:26px;margin-top:7px">Top Raiders</h2></div><span class="tag">OPT-IN</span></div><p class="muted" style="line-height:1.6;margin:0">Choose how you want to join. Telegram identifies you automatically inside the Mini App; Phantom connects the Solana wallet used for rewards.</p><div class="leaderConnectGrid"><button class="leaderConnect telegram" type="button" id="connectTelegramButton"><span>✈️</span><span><b>CONNECT TELEGRAM</b><small id="telegramConnectHint">Open from Telegram to verify your account</small></span></button><button class="leaderConnect phantom" type="button" id="connectLeaderboardPhantomButton"><span>👻</span><span><b>CONNECT PHANTOM</b><small id="phantomConnectHint">Connect your Solana wallet</small></span></button></div><div class="leaderIdentity" id="leaderIdentity"><div class="status">No identity connected yet.</div></div><div class="leaderForm" id="leaderManualForm" style="display:none"><label class="form"><span>Leaderboard Username</span><input id="leaderUsername" placeholder="@yourusername" maxlength="33"></label></div><button class="primary" style="width:100%;margin-top:12px" type="button" id="joinLeaderboardButton" disabled>JOIN LEADERBOARD</button><div class="leaderMember" id="leaderMemberStatus"></div><div class="leaderRules"><div class="leaderRule">👀 <b>+1 point</b> for a valid raid view.</div><div class="leaderRule">🎪 <b>+2 points</b> for a valid Sponsored Offer view.</div><div class="leaderRule">⏱️ The same raid awards <b>1 point per 24 hours</b> to prevent refresh farming.</div><div class="leaderRule">❤️ X likes and 💬 comments are not automatically scored yet.</div><div class="leaderRule">🚫 Obvious spam or farming can be excluded before rewards are paid.</div></div><div class="status ok" id="rewardPoolStatus" style="margin-top:14px">Reward pool: 0.030 SOL</div><div class="table" id="leaderboardList"><div class="status">Loading live leaderboard…</div></div></div><div class="panel"><div class="eyebrow">REWARD POOL</div><h2 style="font-size:26px;margin:8px 0 12px">Funded by the Circus</h2><div class="metrics"><div class="metric"><b id="rewardBase">0.030</b><span>Base SOL</span></div><div class="metric"><b id="rewardRevenue">0.000</b><span>10% Revenue SOL</span></div></div><p class="muted" style="line-height:1.6;margin-top:16px">The starting pool is 0.03 SOL. As paid campaigns come in, 10% of eligible paid campaign revenue is added.</p><div class="status" id="rewardPoolUpdated">Loading reward pool…</div></div></div></section>
